/tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-PWI2nCp1' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-11-22 21:05:54.957 xcodebuild[87484:74074701]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-11-22 21:05:55.092 xcodebuild[87484:74074700] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-R0ybFEYK' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-11-22 21:05:55.431 xcodebuild[87486:74074710]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-11-22 21:05:55.543 xcodebuild[87486:74074708] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\n M docs/CURRENT_STATE.md\n M docs/DECISIONS-log.md\n M docs/DECISIONS.md\n?? docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
